              "ahn-dee-AH-goh-ah",
              "I'd like a bigger one."
            ],
            [
              "Hau hartuko dut.",
              "AH-oo ahr-TOO-koh doot",
              "I'll take this one."
            ],
            [
              "Besterik?",
              "BEHS-teh-reek",
              "Anything else?"
            ],
            [
              "Poltsa bat, mesedez.",
